{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-40","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"If two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, but the rectangle contained by them rational, be added together, the whole straight line is irrational; and let it be called the side of a rational plus a medial area.","book":10,"number":40,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.40","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.40/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":40,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","contentId":"euclid-10-40","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a6fff5e464ea346bd291701bea9c80026d60837b0851f6a1d017b3ac16eeb50","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-40.statement","euclid-10-40.construction.1","euclid-10-40.proof.1","euclid-10-40.proof.2","euclid-10-40.proof.3","euclid-10-40.conclusion","euclid-10-40.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-40.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-40","revisionId":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7379d530494ce3706337a994eeaf4108e4d32af38902a2cb810058248ee2bae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, but the rectangle contained by them rational, be added together, the whole straight line is irrational; and let it be called the side of a rational plus a medial area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将正方形的正方形直线不可公度(中项无理线段)加在一起,但有理则加在一起,则整条直线为无理;让它称为有理加中项无理线段区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-40.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-40","revisionId":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56a4499d678c2834e06be9276d4460878e0a630b3b664619bf571654b4b88838","citations":["euclid-10-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two straight lines AB, BC incommensurable in square, and fulfilling the given conditions [[X. 34](/principles/euclid-10-34) ], be added together; I say that AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将两条AB线,BC 不可公度线加在一起,满足特定条件;我说AC线是无理。 [ [X. 34](/principles/euclid-10-34)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-40.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-40","revisionId":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47f930b7f351fc42b367f189b15059205f05d4f83913b8f8aba09911376e497b","citations":["euclid-10-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the sum of the squares on AB, BC is medial, while twice the rectangle AB, BC is rational, therefore the sum of the squares on AB, BC is incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC; so that the square on AC is also incommensurable with twice the rectangle AB, BC. [[X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB的正方形和BC是中项无理线段,而矩形和AB的两倍是有理,因此AB的正方形和BC是不可公度,不可公度的两倍是BC;因此,AC的正方形和不可公度也是不可公度,不可公度是矩形和BC的两倍 [ [X. 16](/principles/euclid-10-16)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-40.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-40","revisionId":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"468d2b1018222e608225b943e6fd94f6be4333258bc42b9d40ccd2440800f512","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But twice the rectangle AB, BC is rational; therefore the square on AC is irrational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但矩形 AB,BC是有理的两倍,因此AC的正方形是无理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-40.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-40","revisionId":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94c32d6429ac838fce35f85dbde83474a44aa19b8ed667801425878052e4ad94","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AC is irrational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以AC是无理 [ [X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-40.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-40","revisionId":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc99317a984aae77f2dd815bb6326fdd1f243a6ed7ace2535a63ed3b91bdf395","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be called the side of a rational plus a medial area. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它称为有理加中项无理线段区 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-40.source","contentId":"euclid-10-40","revisionId":"euclid-10-40@raw-4a6fff5e464ea346","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2717818aad945046a92a33f163af7f632ce01786302fdbc767c02886cb04f16e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"pro